Date: Sat, 17 Jan 2026 19:19:10 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: add meta mutation commands (add, set, delete)

Implemented three new meta CLI commands:
- meta add <type>: Create new agents, workflows, or conventions
- meta set <ref>: Update existing meta items
- meta delete <ref>: Delete meta items (with --confirm flag)

All commands support JSON output via global --json flag and use
type-safe operations. Added comprehensive integration tests (18 new tests).

Task: @01KF4WVWQ
Spec: @meta-commands

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
